The frontend's locked-track cross has WORD x/y at 0x46968c/0x46968e.
Original Front_End stores y then x with MOV WORD at 0x45060d/0x450614
(and hidden coordinates at 0x450622/0x450629). DWORD x erased y,
placing the visible cross at the top of the screen after a championship.
The season-result underline lengths at 0x46ae26/0x46ae32 are also
WORDs: FUN_004549c4 uses MOV WORD in every outcome, including
0x454abe/0x454ac5 for Relegated Out. DWORD lengths overwrote the next
two packed RGB bytes, changing the underline's color. Restore these
four field widths without altering the menu decisions or rendering.

--- a/dd2_symbols.h
+++ b/dd2_symbols.h
@@ -2314,8 +2314,8 @@
